     2146         if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted pol17 CHR(9)
     2147                     pol18 skip.
     2148       end.
     2149       else do:
     2150         if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted CHR(9) skip.
     2151       end.
     2152     END.
     2153     DOWN 1 STREAM PrnLibstream WITH FRAME FRAME-2.
     2154     if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted FILL( CHR(9), 17 ) skip.
