     2203         DISPLAY STREAM PrnLibstream pol13 sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12 sym13 sym14 sym15 sym16 sym17 WITH FRAME FRAME-2.
